'''Bapta''' (bap′tä), ''n.'' [NL., < Gr. βαπτός, dipped, dyed, verbal adj. of βάπτειν, dip.] A genus of geometrid moths. {{smaller|The white pinion-spotted moth is ''B. bimaculata''; the clouded silver-moth is ''B. punctata''.}}

